// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3233480538" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Before we can act on Captain Sherman's information, we need a clear corridor. I've re-opened talks with Longbow. We need their help to boost our portal's signal if we're going to investigate that Nemesis Army base in the Shadow Shard. They're willing to meet with one of us to hear what we have to say, and I'd like you to be the one to talk to them."
// AcceptString :
"P1171640975" "Meet with Longbow"
// SendOffString :
"P2456434567" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>I know you probably don't have a great relationship with Captain Dietrich, but at least she knows you're one of our best. Lt. Sefu Tendaji should be there, too. He's been friendly to us in the past. He might be able to help win her over to our side."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P510287647" "Whatever happens, we need Longbow on our side."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2909221576" "This isn't the kind of reception you expected! The base is under attack from the Nemesis Army!"

