// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4150586182" "You found vital Nemesis Army documents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3273504788" "You have the evidence you need to prove Nemesis' involvement in the Rikti War."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P368951599" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>I wouldn't have hoped for this much, but I'll take it. We'll talk to our Traditionalist allies and get all the corroborating evidence. And then we're going to get the truth out."
// RandomFameString :
"P2643182881" "I heard the Vanguard are gonna make a big announcement soon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1683133139" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>We're getting the truth about the Rikti War out any way possible. Incandescent is using every resource of the Herald Division and Dietrich has taken it to the Longbow brass. They're disseminating it all over the city and the country through Freedom Corps. The Nemesis Army is attempting to suppress the information, by any means necessary. One place where they may succeed is in the Rogue Isles. It's tough enough to get any information out through the layers of Arachnos control, but now there's a wave of Nemesis attacks on news agencies and reporters. The people of the Rogue Isles deserve to know the truth and I want you to help make sure they learn it."
// AcceptString :
"P3760791094" "Spread the news in the Rogue Isles"
// SendOffString :
"P753794083" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>You're going to the WSPDR building. The Nemesis Army has cut the main power, but WSPDR has set up 4 back-up generators. You've got to make sure that at least 1 generator survives. We have a few people on the scene to help you, but Arachnos has mobilized against what they see as a Nemesis Army invasion, so it's going to get difficult. <color orange>Your objectives are to protect at least 1 generator, rescue Amanda Vines, WSPDR's star reporter, and take out the leader of the Arachnos forces</color>. That should give WSPDR enough time and power to transmit. <br><br>It might be a good idea to have allies along on this one. Just my advice."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P543668194" "Get the News Out!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2919587332" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>Remember, you've got to protect the generators, rescue Amanda Vines, and defeat whoever's in charge of the Arachnos troops. It's a lot to ask."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1346277839" "The brave reporters of WSPDR are desperately trying to stay on the air despite being caught between the Nemesis Army and Arachnos."
// DisplayTextList :
"P721347207" "Generators Remaining"

