// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2672194096" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>Bu'Dekka and her troops are being debriefed and cared for in a hidden location. The information they brought is vitally important, and coincides with energy readings we've been getting from the cavern beneath the Rikti ship. We believe that Hro'Dtohz is about to open and expand the conduit between our world and the Rikti Homeworld to bring through vast numbers of troops. And we're going to have to stop him."
// RandomFameString :
"P1306698484" "Did you see this on the news? Rikti Defectors? Nemesis starting the war? And {HeroName} in the middle of it all!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4167003407" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Final<br><br></color>It's time to save the world, {HeroName}. Hro'Dtohz is going to bring over the entire Rikti military from the Homeworld and he has to be stopped. Portal Corp thinks they can jam him for a while, but we need someone who's been in that portal chamber beneath the ship to lead the strike. I'm putting this in your hands. <color orange>I'd recommend a team, but if you want to go it alone, I'll trust your judgment.</color> The fate of the world is in your hands."
// AcceptString :
"P4161777392" "Stop Hro'Dtohz and save the world"
// SendOffString :
"P3318048915" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Final<br><br></color>We'll be launching a major assault once you're inside, but that's just a distraction to help you get in. Once you're in the main cavern, there are two things you're going to need to do: <br><br>Defeat Hro'Dtohz himself. This will cause him to medi-vac back to the Homeworld and from what Bu'Dekka tells us he'll be busy just trying to keep the rest of the Rikti from discovering the truth about the War to come back and bother us. <br><br>Disrupt the Homeworld portal itself, that will make a massive transit too dangerous, also ending the threat for now. If another major threat were to appear, it could throw the Rikti into confusion, causing them to lock the Homeworld down for a time. <br><br>Good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3475127827" "Save the World"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3589544012" "<color deepskyblue>The Horror of War<br>Part: Final<br><br></color>Remember, you only need to Defeat Hro'Dthoz and disrupt the Homeworld portal to make this a win. Choose your target well and good luck."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3204856134" "It's been a long time since you were here last. Now it's time to finish what you started."

