// 9 B_Boss :
"P2482632275" "<em Disagree t=3>I'm afraid that I cannot allow you to win, {HeroName}! <em welcome t=6>Not when I'm on the cusp of a victory you can barely even conceive!"
// 24 B_Boss :
"P2340161364" "<t=4>With my role revealed, it's time to activate my secondary plan. <em lecture t=6>You see, I'm going to upload a copy of my superior intellect into the Rikti's mental network. <em laugh t=4>Soon I shall be distributed across 2 billion minds. <em Elaugh t=4>An immortal will with innumerable legions for a body! <em fancybow t=4>You may now applaud my audacity... <em point>But I cannot let you stop me!"

